# Winterspring and Eastern Plaguelands, Alliance ~53 to ~55 (consensus visits 64 and 65).
# Flow: Everlook -> west along the road: Starfall Village, the Ruins of Kel'Theril, Donova Snowden, Salfa and the
# western Winterfall camp -> hearth Everlook -> Winterfall Village and the Ice Thistle Hills -> Everlook -> the
# hills again -> Everlook -> Starfall Village -> south to Jaron's crate and wagon, Darkwhisper Gorge -> back to Starfall,
# Donova and Salfa -> out through Timbermaw Hold to the Eastern Kingdoms -> Southshore, Alterac, Chillwind Camp ->
# Darrowshire -> Light's Hope Chapel (flight path, inn) -> Corin's Crossing -> the chapel -> the Undercroft and
# Terrordale -> hearth Light's Hope Chapel -> fly to Chillwind Camp.
# Optional: Zaeldarr the Outcast (6021): Zaeldarr is a level 54 elite at the bottom of the Undercroft.
# Deviations from the export (same quest set, local order fixed):
# - Every Everlook quest but Harlo's is taken on the first pass (3783, 6603), Umi's and Felnok's hills are done in
#   one eastern loop after the hearth, and one hearth to Everlook instead of two: Jaron's crate and Darkwhisper
#   Gorge are done on the way back west instead of after a second hearth.
# - Enraged Wildkin (6604, 4861-4864, quest level 59) waits until level 54, so it is not red: the second yeti hunt
#   ends with a short grind to 54, Harlo's quest is taken at the last Everlook stop and handed to Jaron at Starfall
#   Village on the way south.
# - Winterfall Activity (8464) is finished in Winterfall Village on the eastern loop instead of in two trips.
# - Light's Hope Chapel's flight path and bind move from the end of the Winterspring visit to the arrival at the
#   chapel. The export reaches the chapel without a route: this guide goes Southshore -> Alterac -> Chillwind
#   Camp (its flight path is taken on arrival, not at the end, and The Everlook Report 6028 is handed in there),
#   then east into the Eastern Plaguelands.
# - Pamela Redpath in Darrowshire is visited on the way in (the southern road passes it), so Uncle Carlin (5241)
#   is handed in on the first stop at the chapel.
# Dropped: Return to Tinkee (4810): the route never returns to the Burning Steppes.
# Left out: Toxic Horrors and Winterfall Runners (5086, 5087): Donova only offers them after Mystery Goo (5085),
#   which starts at the Deadwood cauldron in Felwood once Falling to Corruption (5084) is done. That is after
#   this guide, so the prerequisite is missing here.
# Carried on: Falling to Corruption (5084, if the flask dropped), the last Are We There, Yeti? (5163), The Videre
# Elixir (3909), Moontouched Wildkin (978), Troubled Spirits of Kel'Theril (5245), Auntie Marlene (5152).
# Optional, by rare drop: Winterfall Firewater (5083: the flask drops about one kill in ten) and Winterfall Ritual
# Totem (8471: a 3% drop, and Kernda speaks to you only from Neutral with the Timbermaw, which the route does not
# reach). Runecloth for Meilosh (6031) stays optional.
# Dropped: Winterfall Activity 6241 (Totemics, Den Watchers, Pathfinders): the quest is gone from the game; Salfa
# gives 8464 instead, which this guide takes.
# No class quests in this stretch.
guide forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring
title Winterspring & Eastern Plaguelands
faction Alliance
levels 53-55
zone Winterspring
next forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Everlook

step Everlook
  sethome "Everlook" npc 11118        -- Innkeeper Vizzie: the last guide binds here, so this usually ticks at once
  accept 5601                         -- Jessica Redpath: keep it for Darrowshire
  accept 6028                         -- Gregor Greystone: keep both for the Plaguelands
  accept 6030
  turnin 4808                         -- Felnok Steelspring
  accept 4809
  accept 3783                         -- Umi Rumplesnicker
  accept 6603                         -- Meggi Peppinrocker

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West along the road

step Starfall Village
  tip Ride west along the road to the night elf village.
  accept 5244                         -- Wynd Nightchaser
  turnin 5244                         -- Jaron Stoneshaper
  accept 5245

step The Ruins of Kel'Theril
  tip The ruins lie around the frozen lake south of Starfall Village. Pick up the four relic fragments lying in the ruins and the Moontouched Feathers on the ground where the wildkin roam.
  collect 12896 quest 5245.1          -- First Relic Fragment
  collect 12897 quest 5245.2          -- Second Relic Fragment
  collect 12898 quest 5245.3          -- Third Relic Fragment
  collect 12899 quest 5245.4          -- Fourth Relic Fragment
  collect 12383 quest 978.1           -- Moontouched Feather

step Donova Snowden
  tip Follow the road west to Donova's camp beside the hot springs.
  turnin 980
  turnin 3908
  accept 3909                         -- Keep it: Gregan in Feralas brews the elixir later
  turnin 6603
  accept 4842
  accept 5082

step Salfa
  tip Salfa guards the mouth of Timbermaw Hold, north-west of Donova.
  turnin 8465
  accept 8464

step The Winterfall camp
  tip The western Winterfall camp sits in the hills between Salfa and Donova. Any furbolg here can drop an Empty Firewater Flask (about one in ten) and, rarely, a Winterfall Ritual Totem: right-click whichever drops. Keep the Runecloth the furbolgs drop for Meilosh.
  kill 7442 quest 5082.1              -- Winterfall Pathfinder
  kill 7440 quest 5082.2              -- Winterfall Den Watcher
  kill 7441 quest 5082.3              -- Winterfall Totemic
  collect 12771 optional              -- Empty Firewater Flask, a rare drop
  accept 5083 optional
  collect 20742 optional              -- Winterfall Ritual Totem, a rare drop
  accept 8471 optional                -- For Kernda in Timbermaw Hold: keep it
  collect 14047 quest 6031.1 optional -- Runecloth, for Meilosh later

step Donova Snowden
  turnin 5082
  turnin 5083 optional
  accept 5084 optional                -- The Deadwood cauldron in Felwood: keep it

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The east

step Winterfall Village
  hearth "Everlook"
  tip The Winterfall furbolg village lies east of Everlook: Shaman (56-57), Den Watchers (55-56) and Ursa (57-58), all above you. Kill the Shaman first, they heal, and pull from the edge. High Chief Winterfall in the cave at the back is elite: stay out.
  kill 7439 quest 8464.1              -- Winterfall Shaman
  kill 7440 quest 8464.2              -- Winterfall Den Watcher
  kill 7438 quest 8464.3              -- Winterfall Ursa

step The Ice Thistle Hills
  tip Ice Thistle yetis live in the hills south of Winterfall Village, Chillwind Chimaeras in the valley toward Everlook.
  collect 12366 quest 3783.1          -- Thick Yeti Fur
  collect 12444 quest 4809.1          -- Uncracked Chillwind Horn

step Everlook
  turnin 3783                         -- Umi Rumplesnicker
  accept 977
  turnin 4809                         -- Felnok Steelspring

step Optional: Sunken Temple
  note Short of level 54 after the yetis? Running the Sunken Temple (50-54) instead of grinding gets you there faster in a group. Come back to Everlook afterwards.

step Pristine Yeti Horns
  tip Back to the hills: only the Ice Thistle Matriarchs and Patriarchs carry the horns. Keep killing yetis until level 54: Harlo's wildkin quests are red before that.
  collect 12367 quest 977.1
  level 54                            -- grind on Ice Thistle Patriarch at the Ice Thistle Hills, Winterspring

step Everlook
  turnin 977
  accept 5163
  use 12928 @61.5,38.6 "Umi's Mechanical Yeti" -- On Legacki, by the inn
  kill 10978 quest 5163.1             -- Legacki: Sprinkle and Quixxil come later
  accept 6604                         -- Harlo Wigglesworth

step Starfall Village
  tip Ride west along the road to Jaron.
  turnin 6604                         -- Jaron Stoneshaper
  accept 4861

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The south

step Jaron's camp
  tip Ride south-east down the valley to Jaron's damaged crate in the snow at Mazthoril, with his wrecked wagon just east of it.
  turnin 4861                         -- Damaged Crate
  accept 4863
  turnin 4863                         -- Jaron's Wagon
  accept 4864

step Jaron's supplies
  tip Pick up the supplies around the wagon and take Jaron's amulet back from the owlbeasts nearby.
  collect 12525 quest 4864.1          -- Jaron's Supplies
  collect 12524 quest 4864.2          -- Blue-feathered Amulet

step Darkwhisper Gorge
  tip Follow Donova's directions to the mouth of Darkwhisper Gorge, past the Frostmaul giants: pass them one at a time.
  goto 59.8,74.2 "Darkwhisper Gorge"
  complete 4842

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back west

step Starfall Village
  tip Ride north-west back to the village.
  turnin 4864                         -- Jaron Stoneshaper

step Donova Snowden
  turnin 4842

step Salfa
