# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To the Plaguelands

step Chillwind Camp
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Walk through Timbermaw Hold to Felwood and fly on to the Eastern Kingdoms (Auberdine, the boat to Menethil Harbor). Fly to Southshore and ride north up the road through Alterac to Chillwind Camp.
  getfp "Chillwind Camp"              -- Bibilfaz Featherwhistle
  turnin 6028                         -- Argent Officer Pureheart

step Pamela Redpath
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Follow the southern road east into the Eastern Plaguelands; the ruins of Darrowshire lie south of it. Pamela's ghost plays by the ruined house at the south end.
  turnin 5601
  accept 5149

step Pamela's doll
  tip The three pieces of the doll lie in the ruined houses of Darrowshire; picking one up can call out ghosts. Combine them into the doll.
  collect 12886 x1 optional           -- Pamela's Doll's Head
  collect 12887 x1 optional           -- Pamela's Doll's Left Side
  collect 12888 x1 optional           -- Pamela's Doll's Right Side
  complete 5149

step Pamela Redpath
  turnin 5149
  accept 5152                         -- Auntie Marlene, in the Western Plaguelands: keep it
  accept 5241

