step Corin's Crossing
  tip The Scourge around Corin's Crossing, west of the chapel, drop both kinds of Scourgestone; Darrowshire Spirits rise from them: talk to each one to free it.
  kill 11064 quest 5211.1 "Free Darrowshire Spirits: talk to them"
  collect 12841 quest 5509.1          -- Invader's Scourgestone
  collect 12840 quest 5510.1          -- Minion's Scourgestone

step Light's Hope Chapel
  turnin 5211                         -- Carlin Redpath
  turnin 5509                         -- Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff
  turnin 5510

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The west

step The Undercroft
  tip Zaeldarr is elite: grouping up is advised. He waits at the bottom of the Undercroft, the crypt in the south-west of the zone.
  collect 15785 quest 6021.1 optional -- Zaeldarr's Head

step Augustus the Touched
  tip Ride north to Terrordale. Augustus lives in the ruined hut, and his receipt book lies in the ruined inn nearby.
  accept 6164
  collect 15884 quest 6164.1
  turnin 6164

step Light's Hope Chapel
  hearth "Light's Hope Chapel"
  turnin 6021 optional                -- Caretaker Alen
  note The next guide starts here and flies to Chillwind Camp.
